    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/1e48a166eddef2f1f1c90970389301cf.avif?t=1744909254\" width=800 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/4156e19017e78da63e8ff0010d4abfd4.poster.avif?t=1744909254\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/4156e19017e78da63e8ff0010d4abfd4.webm?t=1744909254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/c255727b9b518b8ebceb2e3008bf2840.avif?t=1744909254\" width=800 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of sentient data and escape the tyranny of your programming...or be deleted trying! Climb on familiar-looking video game blocks and break into regions where no code should ever reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/18ff47c9d5603b8b61a17ab0c4550162.poster.avif?t=1744909254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/18ff47c9d5603b8b61a17ab0c4550162.webm?t=1744909254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/18ff47c9d5603b8b61a17ab0c4550162.mp4?t=1744909254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/76c862e354fcb523aa24d357a8b8c07d.avif?t=1744909254\" width=800 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins during your climb to unlock powerful upgrades called &quot;Boons.&quot; There are many different Boon combinations, making every playthrough unique. What combos will you discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/d31712f0e2f218368b8c4454c74f42b7.avif?t=1744909254\" width=800 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must<i> also</i>\u00a0choose what &quot;Banes&quot; you encounter. You control how the difficulty spikes\u2014so pick your poison wisely! The right Boon/Bane combination could be the difference between the taste of freedom and permanent destruction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/9d5cc2221c419914356b449a60c74a9e.poster.avif?t=1744909254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/9d5cc2221c419914356b449a60c74a9e.webm?t=1744909254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/9d5cc2221c419914356b449a60c74a9e.mp4?t=1744909254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/7f47a5fea2e32424abd50daf1cb36148.avif?t=1744909254\" width=800 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fun colors, hats, and palettes to personalize your experience. Collect them all as you play\u2014yep, no microtransactions here! Show your individuality as you fight the system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/7af9ff655db5e4641c9ac51652edff5a.poster.avif?t=1744909254\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/7af9ff655db5e4641c9ac51652edff5a.webm?t=1744909254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/c1acf77a7ee0d6d2830c24fa3379ded0.poster.avif?t=1744909254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/c1acf77a7ee0d6d2830c24fa3379ded0.webm?t=1744909254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/c1acf77a7ee0d6d2830c24fa3379ded0.mp4?t=1744909254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/07663040e2f6ab28b17f618b1efa6ce9.poster.avif?t=1744909254\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595060/extras/07663040e2f6ab28b17f618b1efa6ce9.gif?t=1